Rate Limit Signals

Check one response for 429 and RateLimit/Retry-After headers; no stress tests.

Usage:
  bash src/functions/rat313.sh [public target]
Example:
  bash src/functions/rat313.sh https://example.org

EDUCATIONAL PURPOSE / PROFESSIONAL USAGE
Only inspect owned or authorized targets. GDPR-conscious use requires
appropriate legal basis, data minimization, and safeguards.
No module certifies GDPR compliance. HTTP checks are low-impact;
rate limits are never bypassed; DOM matches are not XSS proof.
